<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/Apple-TV-4K-4th-Generation-Top-View5.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="brief size-full wp-image-1070637" align="left" style="float:left;margin:0 20px 20px 0;width:160px;height:auto;" />The fourth-generation Apple TV 4K began arriving to customers today, and some users <a href="https://www.iculture.nl/nieuws/youtube-apple-tv-4k-2026-werkt-niet/">noticed the YouTube app is not working</a>. If you have encountered this issue, make sure tvOS 27.2 is installed via Settings → System → Software Updates. If it already is, you may need to restart the Apple TV via Settings → System → Restart. Last, you may need to uninstall and reinstall the YouTube app.<br/>
